1. MuseScore Studio engine (WebAssembly build)
----------------------------------------------

   Upstream: https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore (4.7.4)
   License:  GPL-3.0-only
   Bundled:  engine/MuseScoreStudio.wasm, engine/MuseScoreStudio.js,
             engine/distr/*, engine/viewer.html (JS glue),
             engine/MuseAudio.js (audio engine wasm, built separately)

   The WASM artifacts were compiled from MuseScore 4.7.4 source with local
   patches to support Qt 6.7.3 / emsdk 3.1.50 / Emscripten.  The full patch
   list and rebuild instructions live in docs/BUILDING.md.

   Source availability: upstream tarball
   https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore/archive/refs/tags/v4.7.4.tar.gz
   plus the patch set recorded in docs/BUILDING.md (offered on request if
   the patch files are not shipped in this distribution).

